## Working With Plans

1. Copy [`exec-plans/_template.md`](exec-plans/_template.md) into `exec-plans/active/` as `YYYY-MM-DD-short-name.md`.
2. Number plans sequentially in the index and record which earlier plans each one depends on.
3. When a plan is done, move the file to `exec-plans/completed/` and move its row to the table above.
